WEBVTT

00:00:56.928 --> 00:01:01.015
or even decide to take our family
from the refugee camp to the city.

00:01:01.349 --> 00:01:03.935
And so when I started going to school,

00:01:03.935 --> 00:01:07.772
I took this [to] heart
and I took school seriously.

00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:11.776
Even though I was just a little kid,
I managed to wake myself out of bed,

00:01:11.818 --> 00:01:13.402
take all three goats to graze

00:01:13.444 --> 00:01:16.489
and be back on time
to dress up and go to school.

00:01:17.406 --> 00:01:19.909
Classes in the refugee camp
can be overcrowded.

00:01:19.951 --> 00:01:23.663
I was one of the nearly 200 students
who sat in a single classroom

00:01:23.663 --> 00:01:25.498
as I tried to focus and learn.

00:01:25.915 --> 00:01:28.543
But besides the problem
of overcrowded classrooms,

00:01:28.584 --> 00:01:31.295
we also had an issue
whereby most of our learning